# The gomuks field case: the dependency olm failed before the change
# was ever reached, and the verdict blamed the bump. A failure naming
# a DIFFERENT port than the one under test records as blocked —
# untested, not disproven — and its worker is released. The trailer
# "Processing of port gomuks failed" names the port under test, but it
# comes last; the first substantive Error line is what is read.
# RECONSTRUCTED from TestSettleRunsDependencyFailureIsBlocked and
# docs/decisions.md, not captured: see README.md.
port: gomuks
outcome: failed
state: blocked
blamed: olm
detail: dependency olm fails to build; the change itself is untested
lint: clean
